        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>First Impressions TTN100036SMTSBR, 1 Inch Back to Back Door Pull Pair with Straight Square Mounts</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Square Door Pull with Square Mounts Pair has a 1 inch grip and straight mounts. The door pulls are 36 inch long with 24 inch mounting centers. The Teton Series 100 Door Pull comes packaged as a back-to-back pair--pulls attach to each other through the door. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the First Impressions Teton Door Handle:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 36\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 24\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 1\" square</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/FII-TTN02-specifications.pdf?v=1704262336\"><b>First Impressions TTN100 Dimensions Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNote: This beautiful door pull is handmade in the USA when you order it—allowing it to be custom designed to fit your specific door application, including <b>Other Lengths</b>. Unfortunately, because of the made-to-order nature of the door handle, it is <b>Not Returnable.</b> Please <a href=\"/pages/contact\">Contact Us</a> with your requirements or if you have any questions.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nPackaged with Back to Back mounting (2 door pulls bolted to each other - 1 door pull for each side of a door). \r\n</p>",
